    "title": "CA 19-9 Test for Pancreatic Cancer: Meaning, False Positives and When to Order",
    "seo_title": "CA 19-9 Test: High, Normal & False Results | QXL",
    "meta_description": "What CA 19-9 measures, why a high or normal result cannot diagnose pancreatic cancer, Lewis antigen limitations and monitoring uses.",
