    "meta_description": "Learn why CA-125 rises, ovarian cancer warning symptoms, NICE 2026 age-specific thresholds, ultrasound pathway and safe interpretation. QXL Bengaluru.",
    "canonical_url": "https://qxldiagnostics.com/blog/ca-125-test-bengaluru",
