    "meta_description": "Learn ANCA, c-ANCA/p-ANCA, PR3/MPO antibodies, kidney and lung vasculitis symptoms, test interpretation, biopsy pathways and limitations.",
    "canonical_url": "https://qxldiagnostics.com/blog/anca-pr3-mpo-test-bengaluru",
