    "title": "ACTH (Adrenocorticotropic Hormone) Test: Uses, Preparation, Results, Limitations & FAQs",
    "seo_title": "ACTH Test: Uses, Results & FAQs | QXL Bengaluru",
    "meta_description": "Patient guide to the ACTH (Adrenocorticotropic Hormone) test: what it measures, why doctors order it, preparation, how results are interpreted, limitations and FAQs. QXL Bengaluru.",
    "canonical_url": "https://qxldiagnostics.com/blog/acth-test-patient-guide",
    "slug": "acth-test-patient-guide",
